    },
    {
      "text": "MORE INFORMATION",
      "x1": 62,
      "y1": 145,
      "x2": 175,
      "y2": 134,
      "page": 5,
      "y1_bin": 142
    },
    {
      "text": "Further information in relation to your account, including details of product benefits and applicable fees and charges, is",
      "x1": 62,
      "y1": 169,
      "x2": 533,
      "y2": 160,
      "page": 5,
      "y1_bin": 167
    },
    {
      "text": "available on request. That information is also contained in the Product Disclosure Statement (PDS) or other disclosure",
      "x1": 62,
      "y1": 181,
      "x2": 532,
      "y2": 172,
      "page": 5,
      "y1_bin": 178
    },
    {
      "text": "document for your account. For a copy of that document, or if you have any other enquiries, you can call Telephone",
      "x1": 62,
      "y1": 193,
      "x2": 520,
      "y2": 184,
      "page": 5,
      "y1_bin": 191
    },
    {
      "text": "Banking on 132 032 from Australia or +61 2 9155 7700 from overseas.",
      "x1": 62,
      "y1": 205,
      "x2": 343,
      "y2": 196,
      "page": 5,
      "y1_bin": 200
    },
    {
      "text": "The above Closing Balance amount may not be the same as the balance payable to you on closure of your account",
      "x1": 62,
      "y1": 228,
      "x2": 522,
      "y2": 219,
      "page": 5,
      "y1_bin": 228
    },
    {
      "text": "(the 'termination value'). Details of the termination value can be obtained by calling Telephone Banking on the numbers",
      "x1": 62,
      "y1": 240,
      "x2": 534,
      "y2": 231,
      "page": 5,
      "y1_bin": 240
    },
    {
      "text": "quoted above. Further information on how to close accounts, including calculation of the termination value, is contained",
      "x1": 62,
      "y1": 252,
      "x2": 536,
      "y2": 243,
      "page": 5,
      "y1_bin": 252
    },
    {
      "text": "in the Product Disclosure Statement (PDS) booklet or other disclosure document for your account.",
      "x1": 62,
      "y1": 264,
      "x2": 452,
      "y2": 255,
      "page": 5,
      "y1_bin": 264
    },
    {
      "text": "We have an internal process for handling and resolving any problem you may have with, or complaints relating to, your",
      "x1": 62,
      "y1": 288,
      "x2": 534,
      "y2": 279,
      "page": 5,
      "y1_bin": 288
    },
    {
      "text": "account or this product. Information about this process can be found in the Product Disclosure Statement (PDS) or",
      "x1": 62,
      "y1": 300,
      "x2": 517,
      "y2": 291,
      "page": 5,
      "y1_bin": 300
    },
    {
      "text": "other disclosure document for your account, or you can contact us on 1300 130 467.",
      "x1": 62,
      "y1": 312,
      "x2": 398,
      "y2": 303,
      "page": 5,
      "y1_bin": 312
    },
    {
      "text": "Remember, if you have a card, always keep your passcode (PIN) secret - don't tell anyone or let them see it. Never",
      "x1": 62,
      "y1": 336,
      "x2": 520,
      "y2": 327,
      "page": 5,
      "y1_bin": 336
    },
    {
      "text": "write your passcode on your card or on anything that could be lost or stolen. If you do need to record a reminder, you",
      "x1": 62,
      "y1": 348,
      "x2": 527,
      "y2": 339,
      "page": 5,
      "y1_bin": 348
    },
    {
      "text": "must make every effort to disguise it. You may be liable for losses if you don't protect your passcode. To help you learn",
      "x1": 62,
      "y1": 360,
      "x2": 533,
      "y2": 351,
      "page": 5,
      "y1_bin": 360
    },
    {
      "text": "how you can protect your card against unauthorised transactions, you can find more information at",
      "x1": 62,
      "y1": 372,
      "x2": 453,
      "y2": 363,
      "page": 5,
      "y1_bin": 372
    },
    {
      "text": "westpac.com.au/dispute. If you are a business customer, please go to westpac.com.au/businessdispute",
      "x1": 62,
      "y1": 384,
      "x2": 474,
      "y2": 375,
      "page": 5,
      "y1_bin": 384
    },
    {
      "text": "If any loan you hold with us is secured by a real property mortgage; the mortgage terms require the property to be",
      "x1": 62,
      "y1": 424,
      "x2": 514,
      "y2": 415,
      "page": 5,
      "y1_bin": 424
    },
    {
      "text": "insured. Please review the replacement value of the property and check with your insurer to ensure you have adequate",
      "x1": 62,
      "y1": 436,
      "x2": 536,
      "y2": 427,
      "page": 5,
      "y1_bin": 436
    },
    {
      "text": "cover. For general information on property insurance, visit the Australian Securities and Investments Commission's",
      "x1": 62,
      "y1": 448,
      "x2": 518,
      "y2": 439,
      "page": 5,
      "y1_bin": 448
    },
    {
