      "x1": 62,
      "y1": 460,
      "x2": 254,
      "y2": 451,
      "page": 5,
      "y1_bin": 460
    },
    {
      "text": "Understanding comprehensive credit reporting",
      "x1": 62,
      "y1": 483,
      "x2": 263,
      "y2": 474,
      "page": 5,
      "y1_bin": 483
    },
    {
      "text": "It's more important than ever to pay on time as this is shown on your consumer credit report as part of comprehensive",
      "x1": 62,
      "y1": 503,
      "x2": 530,
      "y2": 494,
      "page": 5,
      "y1_bin": 503
    },
    {
      "text": "credit reporting (CCR).",
      "x1": 62,
      "y1": 515,
      "x2": 153,
      "y2": 506,
      "page": 5,
      "y1_bin": 515
    },
    {
      "text": "CCR provides you with a more complete picture of your credit history including your on time and late repayments. You",
      "x1": 62,
      "y1": 535,
      "x2": 530,
      "y2": 526,
      "page": 5,
      "y1_bin": 535
    },
    {
      "text": "can also see your consumer credit account open and closed dates, type of credit, credit limit and it now includes",
      "x1": 62,
      "y1": 547,
      "x2": 507,
      "y2": 538,
      "page": 5,
      "y1_bin": 547
    },
    {
      "text": "whether you are in a financial hardship arrangement.",
      "x1": 62,
      "y1": 559,
      "x2": 272,
      "y2": 550,
      "page": 5,
      "y1_bin": 559
    },
    {
      "text": "For more information please see our website, our Privacy Statement or visit CreditSmart.org.au.",
      "x1": 62,
      "y1": 579,
      "x2": 446,
      "y2": 570,
      "page": 5,
      "y1_bin": 579
    },
    {
      "text": "Complaints",
      "x1": 62,
      "y1": 607,
      "x2": 111,
      "y2": 598,
      "page": 5,
      "y1_bin": 603
    },
    {
      "text": "If you have a complaint, contact our dedicated Customer Solutions team on 132 032 or write to us at Westpac",
      "x1": 62,
      "y1": 619,
      "x2": 498,
      "y2": 610,
      "page": 5,
      "y1_bin": 619
    },
    {
      "text": "Customer Solutions, Reply Paid 5265, Sydney NSW 2001. If an issue has not been resolved to your satisfaction, you",
      "x1": 62,
      "y1": 631,
      "x2": 527,
      "y2": 622,
      "page": 5,
      "y1_bin": 631
    },
    {
      "text": "can lodge a complaint with the Australian Financial Complaints Authority (AFCA). AFCA provides fair and independent",
      "x1": 62,
      "y1": 643,
      "x2": 530,
      "y2": 634,
      "page": 5,
      "y1_bin": 643
    },
    {
